sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor user as User
  participant ui as Svelte UI
  participant rust as Rust ssh client
  participant vault as Vault
  participant host as Remote host
  participant plug as Plugins
  user->>ui: open saved session
  ui->>rust: invoke connect
  rust->>vault: read credentials
  rust->>host: SSH handshake
  host-->>rust: server public key
  alt fingerprint matches known_hosts.json
    rust->>host: authenticate
  else unknown or changed key
    rust->>ui: ssh-hostkey-prompt event
    ui->>user: verify fingerprint
    user->>rust: trust or reject
  end
  rust->>plug: session:connected hook
  rust-)ui: terminal output events
